# VitePress
docs/.vitepress/cache/
docs/.vitepress/dist/
# docs/architecture is allowlist-published. Default-ignore everything inside;
# add a `!` exception for each file we want tracked. Keeps private
# rescue/kickoff notes off-repo while letting public design notes ship.
docs/architecture/*
!docs/architecture/hexabot-vs-agentx.md
!docs/architecture/plugins.md
!docs/architecture/surface-contract.md
!docs/architecture/workflows-yaml.md
!docs/architecture/persistent-claude-process.md
!docs/architecture/typed-workflow-dsl-plan.md
!docs/architecture/workflow-absorb-plan.md
!docs/architecture/three-tier.md
!docs/architecture/surface-reduction.md
!docs/architecture/design-system.md

src/web/workflow-editor/HANDOFF.md
docs/prd

# Design canvas working files (published as an Artifact, not product code)
.design/
